{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>It is a kindness.</b> An Aramaic expression — חִסּוּדָא, disgrace. Its midrash: if you say Cain married his sister — the Omnipresent did a kindness, to build the world from him, as it says (Psalms 89), ״עוֹלָם חֶסֶד יִבָּנֶה״ (Sifra; Sanhedrin 58)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:25.215183870Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}